        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[clamp(24px,3.5vw,32px)] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mb-2">Frequently asked questions</h2>

        {[
          { q: "How much should I set aside for taxes as a UGC creator?", a: "A common recommendation is 25-30% of every payment. This covers both self-employment tax (15.3%) and federal income tax (10-22% for most creators). If you live in a state with income tax, consider setting aside 30-35%. It is better to over-save and get a refund than to face a surprise bill." },
