          { q: "Can I deduct my home internet and phone as a UGC creator?", a: "Yes, but only the business-use portion. If you estimate that 60% of your internet usage is for UGC work (uploading content, research, platform management), you can deduct 60% of your internet bill. The same applies to your phone plan. Keep a log or reasonable estimate of business versus personal usage." },
